-rulin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","quote":"伏生教濟南張生及歐陽生，歐陽生教千乘兒寬。兒寬既通尚書，以文學應郡舉，詣博士受業，受業孔安國。兒寬貧無資用，常為弟子都養，及時時閒行傭賃，以給衣食。行常帶經，止息則誦習之。以試第次，補廷尉史。是時張湯方鄉學，以為奏讞掾，以古法議決疑大獄，而愛幸寬。寬為人溫良，有廉智，自持，而善著書、書奏，敏於文，口不能發明也。湯以為長者，數稱譽之。及湯為御史大夫，以兒寬為掾，薦之天子。天子見問，說之。張湯死后六年，兒寬位至御史大夫。九年而以官卒。寬在三公位，以和良承意從容得久，然無有所匡諫；於官，官屬易之，不為盡力。張生亦為博士。而伏生孫以治尚書徵，不能明也。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0018"}],"interpretation_note":"原文明示死或卒；死后六年與九年保留來源相對時間，尚未據此換算公元年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"