"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0402","start":402,"end":405,"surface":"杜延年","kind":"person","person_id":"8hw_b9c_lvq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0409","start":409,"end":411,"surface":"黃霸","kind":"person","person_id":"kmo_vp5_qe1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0412","start":412,"end":414,"surface":"王成","kind":"person","person_id":"qf6_ach_02x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0415","start":415,"end":417,"surface":"龔遂","kind":"person","person_id":"qac_69v_ntg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0418","start":418,"end":420,"surface":"鄭弘","kind":"person","person_id":"8wl_6mv_qn8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0421","start":421,"end":424,"surface":"邵信臣","kind":"person","person_id":"nk6_bxx_ot8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0425","start":425,"end":428,"surface":"韓延壽","kind":"person","person_id":"iff_ztt_r2h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0429","start":429,"end":432,"surface":"尹翁歸","kind":"person","person_id":"ji8_fud_li3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0433","start":433,"end":436,"surface":"趙廣漢","kind":"person","person_id":"5dy_3tn_y1j","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","text":"伏生教濟南張生及歐陽生，歐陽生教千乘兒寬。兒寬既通尚書，以文學應郡舉，詣博士受業，受業孔安國。兒寬貧無資用，常為弟子都養，及時時閒行傭賃，以給衣食。行常帶經，止息則誦習之。以試第次，補廷尉史。是時張湯方鄉學，以為奏讞掾，以古法議決疑大獄，而愛幸寬。寬為人溫良，有廉智，自持，而善著書、書奏，敏於文，口不能發明也。湯以為長者，數稱譽之。及湯為御史大夫，以兒寬為掾，薦之天子。天子見問，說之。張湯死后六年，兒寬位至御史大夫。九年而以官卒。寬在三公位，以和良承意從容得久，然無有所匡諫；於官，官屬易之，不為盡力。張生亦為博士。而伏生孫以治尚書徵，不能明也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":